---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "@components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About — iSamuelDev">
  <Header slot="header" />

  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">About</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p>
        Welcome to iSamuelDev, a fast, minimal developer blog and a free Astro
        theme, built with Astro and Tailwind CSS. Here I write about web
        development, tools, and building real projects on a budget.
      </p>

      <h2>Who runs this?</h2>
      <p>
        I'm iSamuel, a solo developer from Nigeria. I taught myself Astro and
        built everything here from my phone, using only GitHub's web editor,
        with no laptop setup. If you're learning to build with limited
        resources, this site is proof that you can start with what you have.
      </p>

      <h2>The free iSamuelDev theme</h2>
      <p>
        iSamuelDev is also a free, open template that you can use for your own
        blog. It includes:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Complete SEO setup with sitemap and structured data</li>
        <li>Image sitemap to help Google discover your images</li>
        <li>PWA support, so your blog can be installed like an app</li>
        <li>Dark mode</li>
        <li>Pagination and tags</li>
        <li>A contact form powered by Formspree</li>
        <li>Fast, mobile-first design with Tailwind CSS</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        It's free to use, and I keep developing and improving it personally.
        New features, fixes, and performance updates come from what I learn
        running my own sites, so the theme is tested in real use and not just
        in demos.
      </p>

      <h2>What do I write about?</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Web development tips and tutorials</li>
        <li>Free tools and stacks for developers on a budget</li>
        <li>Astro, Tailwind CSS, and modern web workflows</li>
        <li>SEO and getting a new site indexed by Google</li>
        <li>Building and shipping projects from a mobile device</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Use the theme or suggest a feature</h2>
      <p>
        Using the theme and found a bug, or have an idea that would make it
        better? I read every message and often build requested features into
        the next update.
        <a href="/contact">Send me a message</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        Have a question or want to collaborate?
        <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
